# Source of truth for the front-page handle of support.netplex.io (NPX-2833).
# Live file: the shared Caddyfile of the tools-tls stack on the Oracle box (not a git checkout).
# Deploy: add the handle inside the existing site block, `caddy validate`, then `caddy reload`.
support.netplex.io {
	handle / {
		header Content-Type text/plain
		header X-Robots-Tag noindex
		respond "netplex support - running" 200
	}
	# ...existing reverse_proxy 127.0.0.1:18099 handle stays as-is
}
